# Verb concepts.
#
#   en verb <base> [past] [participle]   irregular forms when needed
#   en takes <preposition>               "wait for X", "look at X": the
#                                        preposition marks the object
#   ru verb <imperfective> [perf:<perfective>]
#      [pres:<1sg>,<2sg>|six forms] [past:<m>,<f>] [imp:<2sg>]
#      [perf-pres:…] [perf-past:…] [perf-imp:…]
#      [hab:<habitual motion verb>] [hab-pres:…]
#      [gov:<case>|gov:<prep>+<case>]   case of the object (default acc)
#      [rec:dat]                        recipient case ("give him")
#      [motion]                         "to"/"in" take direction (в + acc)
#      [exp-dat]                        experiencer in dative, theme as
#                                       subject ("мне нравится книга")
#   object-class <classes>              classes the object prefers

concept read
  class communication
  en verb read read read
  ru verb читать perf:прочитать

concept write
  class communication
  en verb write wrote written
  ru verb писать perf:написать pres:пишу,пишешь perf-pres:напишу,напишешь

concept speak
  class communication
  en verb speak spoke spoken
  en verb talk
  en takes to with about
  ru verb говорить perf:поговорить gov.to:с+ins gov.with:с+ins gov.about:о+prep

concept say
  class communication
  en verb say said said
  ru verb говорить perf:сказать perf-pres:скажу,скажешь rec:dat

